stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: ingest accepted
  pending --> segments_ready: shot worker published N segments
  segments_ready --> visual_partial: first visual upsert
  visual_partial --> searchable: visual_done equals N
  visual_partial --> blocked: required segment in embed DLQ
  blocked --> visual_partial: operator replay
  searchable --> caption_complete: caption_done equals N
  caption_complete --> [*]
  searchable --> [*]: caption optional
